# Downloaded source data. Never committed. What IS committed is the manifest
# that makes each cache reproducible byte for byte - URLs, SHA-256 digests
# and citations - plus the small real-data fixtures that let the tests run
# offline:
#
#   data/connectome/  ~8 MB, Allen connectome matrices + CCF ontology (P3.1);
#                     the voxel-scale files are another 600 MB if a later
#                     task needs them. Manifest: connectome/sources.py.
#                     Verify: python scripts/fetch_connectome.py --verify-only
#   data/expression/  ~7.5 MB, Allen ISH structure unionizes for 42 receptor
#                     genes (P4.1). Manifest: expression/sources.py.
#                     Verify: python scripts/fetch_expression.py --verify-only
data/
/data
tasks/backlog.json.tmp
